# Raycast keeps command hotkeys in an encrypted database, so list yours here
# (skhd syntax, one per line) and `hotkey-check` will diff them against skhd
# and macOS. Copy to ~/.config/macarchy/raycast-hotkeys.
# alt - t              # Set Theme (script command) -- NOT `alt - space`: that's Handy's
# cmd + shift - n      # Floating Notes
